## Caelestia

https://github.com/caelestia-dots/shell — Copyright (c) soramanew, GPL-3.0.

The shell tree under `shell/` originates from Caelestia and is carried here in
full: the bar, drawers, dashboard, launcher, lock screen, session menu, sidebar,
utilities, background, services, components and utils are Caelestia's work.
Changes made in this repo are described in `docs/DIVERGENCE.md`.

## Tide Island

https://github.com/enhaoswen/Tide-island — Copyright (c) enhaoswen, GPL-3.0.

`shell/modules/island/` is a reimplementation of Tide Island's Dynamic Island
for Caelestia. It contains no code from Tide Island: the layer set, the
priority ordering between them and the morphing-capsule idea come from that
project, but every line here is written against Caelestia's own services and
components. The C++ backend Tide ships (`IslandBackend`) has no counterpart
here and is not required.

If you want the original, standalone Dynamic Island, install Tide Island
itself — it is a complete shell in its own right and does considerably more
than this module does.

